:''Not to be confused with [[Ragin' Gory]].''
'''Gory Dark''' (ブラッゴリ, ''Buraggori'', '''Black Gory''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Gory]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

