==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], he was called Gory Black.
*Gory Dark's Japanese name, ブラッゴリ ''Buraggori'', is a portmanteau of ブラック ''burakku'' (black) and ''gorilla''.
*Despite being introduced later than [[Shadow Boxer K]], Gory Dark is listed earlier in the Enemy Guide and has a lower ID than her.
*The 4koma "[https://app.famitsu.com/20140214_314143/ Working Black Gory-san]" (働くブラッゴリさん ''Hataraku Buraggori-san'') shows how [[Gory]] became Gory Dark.

